<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Camunda 7 BPMN 2.0 Process Definition: Digitale Vorqualifizierung (AVPQ)
  
  This is a placeholder for the main pre-qualification process.
  
  Key process elements:
  - Applicant company submission
  - Parallel self-declarations from managing directors
  - Document validation by ABSt (external examination body)
  - Final decision by IHK (chamber of commerce)
  - Message correlation for external events (e.g., supplementary documents)
  
  All forms are dynamically generated from JSON Schema (see schemas/ directory).
  No static UI forms are referenced in this process definition.
-->
